      "title": "README",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# PIMPMYPONY TXT2IMG with WILDCARDS support\n\n## 🖥️ Civitai Model \n\n \n- [🔗 PimpMyPony - Real Anime](https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=2628215)\n- [🔗 PimpMyPony - InCase Style](https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=2611135)\n- [🔗 PimpMyPony - Semi Real Anime](https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=1346446)\n\n---\n\n## ⬆️ UPSCALE MODEL\n\n- [🔗 2xLexicaRRDBNet](https://huggingface.co/huchukato/favs/resolve/main/ESRGAN/2xLexicaRRDBNet.pth)\n- [🔗 2xLexicaRRDBNet_Sharp](https://huggingface.co/huchukato/favs/resolve/main/ESRGAN/2xLexicaRRDBNet_Sharp.pth)\n\n---\n\n## 🎛️ AutoTag Node with Wildcards included\nInstall it from ComfyUI Manager or clone the repo\n```\ncd ComfyUI/custom_nodes\ngit clone https://github.com/huchukato/comfy-tagcomplete.git\n```\n\n✨ New in v2.0.0 - Wildcard Sub-Selection\nThis version introduces a1111-sd-webui-tagcomplete style wildcard sub-selection, making wildcard usage more intuitive and powerful:\n\n🎯 Wildcard Workflow\n- Type __ to see available wildcards\n- Select a wildcard with arrow keys and press Enter → inserts __wildcard_name__\n- Auto-show options → immediately displays all options from that wildcard\n- Select an option with arrow keys and press Enter → replaces wildcard with chosen option\nESC → keeps inserted wildcard and closes options\n\n🌟 Features\n- Smart parsing: Handles wildcards with complex paths (e.g., __mbe/blwjob/blwjb__)\n- Line-by-line options: Each line in wildcard file becomes a separate option\n- Text overflow handling: Long options are truncated with hover expansion\n- Full compatibility: Works with existing wildcard files and formats\n- Multiple sources: Supports wildcards from repository, ComfyUI/models, DynamicPrompts, and Impact-Pack\n\n📁 Wildcard Sources (in priority order):\n- Repository wildcards/ folder\n- ComfyUI models/wildcards/\n- ComfyUI custom_nodes/wildcards/\n- DynamicPrompts wildcards/\n- Extra model paths configuration\n- Impact-Pack wildcards\n- Impact-Pack.ini custom paths\n\nThis extension is based on ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts.\n\n## 📁 Manual Wildcard Setup (Optional)\n\nIf you're installing manually or want to use wildcards with Easy-Use, you may need to copy the wildcards folder:\n\n1. **Copy wildcards to Impact Pack:**\n   ```bash\n   cp -r /path/to/comfy-tagcomplete/wildcards /path/to/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Easy-Use/wildcards/\n   ```\n\n2. **Restart ComfyUI** to load the new wildcards\n\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# PIMPMYPONY TXT2IMG with WILDCARDS support\n\n## 🖥️ Civitai Model \n\n \n- [🔗 PimpMyPony - Real Anime](https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=2628215)\n- [🔗 PimpMyPony - InCase Style](https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=2611135)\n- [🔗 PimpMyPony - Semi Real Anime](https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=1346446)\n\n---\n\n## ⬆️ UPSCALE MODEL\n\n- [🔗 2xLexicaRRDBNet](https://huggingface.co/huchukato/favs/resolve/main/ESRGAN/2xLexicaRRDBNet.pth)\n- [🔗 2xLexicaRRDBNet_Sharp](https://huggingface.co/huchukato/favs/resolve/main/ESRGAN/2xLexicaRRDBNet_Sharp.pth)\n\n---\n\n## 🎛️ AutoTag Node with Wildcards included\nInstall it from ComfyUI Manager or clone the repo\n```\ncd ComfyUI/custom_nodes\ngit clone https://github.com/huchukato/comfy-tagcomplete.git\n```\n\n✨ New in v2.0.0 - Wildcard Sub-Selection\nThis version introduces a1111-sd-webui-tagcomplete style wildcard sub-selection, making wildcard usage more intuitive and powerful:\n\n🎯 Wildcard Workflow\n- Type __ to see available wildcards\n- Select a wildcard with arrow keys and press Enter → inserts __wildcard_name__\n- Auto-show options → immediately displays all options from that wildcard\n- Select an option with arrow keys and press Enter → replaces wildcard with chosen option\nESC → keeps inserted wildcard and closes options\n\n🌟 Features\n- Smart parsing: Handles wildcards with complex paths (e.g., __mbe/blwjob/blwjb__)\n- Line-by-line options: Each line in wildcard file becomes a separate option\n- Text overflow handling: Long options are truncated with hover expansion\n- Full compatibility: Works with existing wildcard files and formats\n- Multiple sources: Supports wildcards from repository, ComfyUI/models, DynamicPrompts, and Impact-Pack\n\n📁 Wildcard Sources (in priority order):\n- Repository wildcards/ folder\n- ComfyUI models/wildcards/\n- ComfyUI custom_nodes/wildcards/\n- DynamicPrompts wildcards/\n- Extra model paths configuration\n- Impact-Pack wildcards\n- Impact-Pack.ini custom paths\n\nThis extension is based on ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts.\n\n## 📁 Manual Wildcard Setup (Optional)\n\nIf you're installing manually or want to use wildcards with Easy-Use, you may need to copy the wildcards folder:\n\n1. **Copy wildcards to Impact Pack:**\n   ```bash\n   cp -r /path/to/comfy-tagcomplete/wildcards /path/to/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Easy-Use/wildcards/\n   ```\n\n2. **Restart ComfyUI** to load the new wildcards\n\n"
